                         Uses Chameleon's actual URL param `set_language` (not
                         `?ln=` — that was wrong in v1). Switches the platform's
                         language layer. Visible text won't change until Greek
                         translations are loaded into the platform; this toggle
                         is the foundation that the translations plug into. -->
                    <div class="mgs_lang_switch" role="group" aria-label="Language">
                        <a class="mgs_lang_btn mgs_lang_en" href="#" onclick="siteSetLanguage('default'); return false;" title="English">EN</a>
                        <span class="mgs_lang_sep" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
